{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04556","headline":"新都南亭送郭元振卢崇道 · 张说","name":"新都南亭送郭元振卢崇道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹径女萝蹊，莲洲文石堤。\n静深人俗断，寻玩往还迷。\n碧潭秀初月，素林惊夕栖。\n褰幌纳蟾影，理琴听猿啼。\n佳辰改宿昔，胜寄坐暌携。\n长怀赏心爱，如玉复如珪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}